{"3798560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KAL", "steam_appid": 3798560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Context</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reunion Island, 1948</strong>. A sudden cyclone forces you to take shelter in a Creole mansion that has been abandoned for years. The temporary refuge quickly turns into a trap as you find yourself caught in a cyclical nightmare, reliving a story of suffering and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.poster.avif?t=1776801709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.webm?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.mp4?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into</strong> an old colonial house locked in time and relive the story of <strong>Kalla</strong>, a slave with a tragic fate at the origin of one of <i>Reunion Island</i>’s most terrifying legends: <strong>Gran-Mèr Kal.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk </strong>through dark corridors by the light of your flashlight and follow the traces of shadows from the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> objects and piece together the fragments of a drama blending folklore, horror, and colonial history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive</strong> into the depths of a terrifying Creole legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.poster.avif?t=1776801709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.webm?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.mp4?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Context</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reunion Island, 1948</strong>. A sudden cyclone forces you to take shelter in a Creole mansion that has been abandoned for years. The temporary refuge quickly turns into a trap as you find yourself caught in a cyclical nightmare, reliving a story of suffering and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.poster.avif?t=1776801709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.webm?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/f9e6cb365a50d8289b0889768588a2f1.mp4?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into</strong> an old colonial house locked in time and relive the story of <strong>Kalla</strong>, a slave with a tragic fate at the origin of one of <i>Reunion Island</i>’s most terrifying legends: <strong>Gran-Mèr Kal.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk </strong>through dark corridors by the light of your flashlight and follow the traces of shadows from the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> objects and piece together the fragments of a drama blending folklore, horror, and colonial history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive</strong> into the depths of a terrifying Creole legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.poster.avif?t=1776801709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.webm?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/extras/3cb268f0ae0a02c726e577e60ae152e7.mp4?t=1776801709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "KAL is a first-person psychological horror game. Trapped in an old, abandoned Creole house, immerse yourself in a time loop and relive the story of a slave who became a true legend.", "supported_languages": "English, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/ae570fe9ae4a8337e8040279b11c66e075f21f1d/header.jpg?t=1776801709", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/4e904a4248c9e6c772ac04eb0c145355b15b2b06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776801709", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798560/4e904a4248c9e6c772ac